# The project's own build backend. uv.lock does not cover [build-system] requires,
# so an offline kit has to carry them separately or `uv sync` cannot build the
# editable install of the project itself (measured: it fails resolving hatchling).
# Regenerate the resolved list with:
#   uv pip compile packaging/build-requires.in --python-version 3.12 -o packaging/build-requires.txt
# Keep it in step with pyproject.toml's [build-system].
hatchling
